urned negative for the current quarter of 2026-Q3 since our <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4937657-outlook-sp500-dividends-august-2026\" rel=\"noopener\">August 2026 snapshot</a>.</p> <p>Projected dividends for 2026-Q3 dropped $0.37 per share during the intervening month. The </p></body></html>",
