            "id": "4946383",
            "title": "Energy Emerges As The Latest Market Shock",
            "description": "<html><body><div class=\"wsb_wrapper\"> <div class=\"wsb_main\"><span><p data-eci=\"true\"><strong>Listen on the go! A daily podcast of Wall Street Breakfast will be available by 8:00 a.m. on <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/author/wall-street-breakfast?utm_source=newsletter&amp;utm_medium=toptext&amp;utm_campaign=wsbpodpromo\">Seeking Alpha</a>, <a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/wall-street-breakfast/id1358381502\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">iTunes</a>, <a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/show/05uLjJxkVgQsRk8LWLCLpx\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Spotify</a>.</strong></p></span></div> <figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture><img alt=\"\" data-id=\"2226780791\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"811\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 36px), (max-width: 1023px) calc(100vw - 132px), (max-width: 1199px) calc(100vw - 666px), (max-width: 1307px) calc(100vw - 708px), 600px\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2226780791/image_2226780791.jpg?io=getty-c-w630\" srcset=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2226780791/image_2226780791.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536 1536w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2226780791/image_2226780791.jpg?io=getty-c-w1280 1280w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2226780791/image_2226780791.jpg?io=getty-c-w1080 1080w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2226780791/image_2226780791.jpg?io=getty-c-w750 750w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2226780791/image_2226780791.jpg?io=getty-c-w640 640w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2226780791/image_2226780791.jpg?io=getty-c-w480 480w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2226780791/image_2226780791.jpg?io=getty-c-w320 320w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2226780791/image_2226780791.jpg?io=getty-c-w240 240w\" width=\"1536\"/><figcaption><p class=\"item-credits\">Getty Images</p></figcaption></picture></figure>\n<p class=\"wsb_bold\" data-skip-content-styles=\"\"> </p> <p><span class=\"b\">Good morning! Here's the latest in trending:</span><br/><br/><span class=\"b\">It's official:</span> U.S. military confirms for the first time <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642737-us-has-weapons-in-space-air-force-secretary-confirms\">it has weapons in space</a>.<br/><br/><span class=\"b\">Financial fallout:</span> <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642640-bank-of-america-plunges-on-ceos-sales-trading-revenue-guidance-bank-stocks-sell-off\">Bank stocks lower</a> after BofA (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/BAC\" title=\"Bank of America Corporation\">BAC</a>) issues sales and trading guidance.<br/><br/><span class=\"b\">City expansion:</span> Waymo (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/GOOGL\" title=\"Alphabet Inc.\">GOOGL</a>) robotaxis are coming to <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642584-waymo-adds-las-vegas-to-expanding-us-robotaxi-network\">Las Vegas</a> and <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642735-waymo-aims-to-launch-robotaxi-service-in-tokyo-in-2027\">Tokyo</a>.</p> <h2><a class=\"!no-underline !text-share-text\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642713-chevron-ceo-wirth-other-us-oil-executives-warn-global-fuel-crisis-has-arrived\">Buffers run dry</a></h2> <p>More doomsday warnings are being sounded across markets. On Monday, it was <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642388-is-existential-ai-panic-driving-the-next-tech-capital-bubble\">AI-driven human extinction</a>. Today, it's an <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642713-chevron-ceo-wirth-other-us-oil-executives-warn-global-fuel-crisis-has-arrived\">emerging fuel crisis</a>. Don't worry, there will be one tomorrow as well, with turmoil hitting the bond market as the <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642742-sp-500-faces-8-10-pullback-risk-as-fed-rate-hikes-loom-strategist-says\">FOMC appears set to hike interest rates</a> for the first time since mid-2023. The 10-year Treasury yield (<a class=\"ticker-link\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/US10Y\">US10Y</a>) has already <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642751-sp500-nasdaq-dow-jones-outlook-stock-market\">surpassed the 5% level</a>, shaking investor confidence and rattling Wall Street.<br/><br/><span class=\"italic\">Crude watch:</span> Facing a worsening economic blockade, Iran has activated its proxy in Yemen, with the Houthis conducting a lightning blitz to control the entire Red Sea coast and even seizing strategic islands. Control of the territory threatens the key chokepoint of Bab al-Mandab, where 12% of global trade passes through each year. It's also a big slap in the face to Saudi Arabia given a likely maritime blockade of the Kingdom's 750-mile East-West Pipeline, which has been key to oil circumventing the Strait of Hormuz. To make matters worse, the key pipeline <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642310-saudi-pipeline-outage-threatens-4-percent-of-global-oil-supply\">came under drone attacks</a>, taking off 4% of global supply and fueling a further fuel crunch. <span class=\"italic\"><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642515-crude-oil-jumps-4-percent-as-key-saudi-red-sea-port-has-just-5minus-7-days-of-oil-left-to\">Just 5-7 days of oil left to export</a><br/><br/></span>The news sent Brent crude (<a class=\"ticker-link\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/CO1:COM\">CO1:COM</a>) above $108/bbl, while WTI futures (<a class=\"ticker-link\" href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/CL1:COM\">CL1:COM</a>) soared past $103/bbl, trading at levels last seen back in May. Concerned about spiraling energy prices, President Trump turned to Ukraine to <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642292-trump-urges-ukraine-to-halt-strikes-on-russian-diesel-facilities\">stop attacking Russian diesel infrastructure</a>, although neither country has independently confirmed they are holding to such an arrangement. Moscow has been forced to ration fuel domestically and ban diesel exports, and when combined with international shipping disruptions, it can put severe upward pressure on global markets.<br/><br/><span class=\"b\">Next red flag:</span> Commercial fuel stocks around the world have been depleting for more than six months, and necessary oil reserves, like the U.S. Strategic Petroleum Reserve, cannot be tapped much further. \"All these mechanisms helped to mitigate the price and supply risk - those have largely now played out, and we don't have nearly the buffers in the system that we did when [the Middle East war] began,\" Chevron (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/CVX\" title=\"Chevron Corporation\">CVX</a>) CEO Mike Wirth declared. \"It's harder to envision a scenario where prices soften and quickly. I think the risks remain to the upside over the next few months.\" (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642713-chevron-ceo-wirth-other-us-oil-executives-warn-global-fuel-crisis-has-arrived\">102 comments</a>)</p> <p class=\"wsb_bold\" data-skip-content-styles=\"\">Here's the latest Seeking Alpha analysis</p> <p><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4945631-before-ai-destroys-world-i-would-first-invest-in-these-bottlenecks\" target=\"_blank\"> Before AI Destroys The World, I'd First Invest In These Bottlenecks</a><br/><br/><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4945626-ai-is-going-rogue-3-stocks-im-buying\" target=\"_blank\">AI Is Going Rogue: 3 Stocks I'm Buying</a><br/><br/><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4945521-2-high-yielders-growing-their-portfolios\" target=\"_blank\">2 High-Yielders That Are Growing Their Portfolios</a><br/><br/><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4945258-ai-apocalypse-narrative-is-sales-pitch\" target=\"_blank\">AI Apocalypse Narrative Is A Sales Pitch</a><br/><br/><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4945888-top-50-high-quality-dividend-growth-stocks-for-september-2026\" target=\"_blank\">Top 50 High-Quality Dividend Growth Stocks For September</a></p> <p class=\"wsb_bold\" data-skip-content-styles=\"\">What else is happening...</p> <p>WSB survey results: The driver behind <span draggable=\"true\"><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/community/conversations/882\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">AI apocalypse warnings</a></span>. <br/><br/>EPA to roll back Biden-era limits on <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642715-epa-to-roll-back-biden-era-limits-on-power-plant-emissions\">power plant emissions</a>.<br/><br/>Costco (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/COST\" title=\"Costco Wholesale Corporation\">COST</a>) hikes motor oil prices and <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642623-costco-hikes-motor-oil-prices-and-limits-purchases\">limits purchases</a>.<br/><br/>Trimming the fat? Novo Nordisk (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/NVO\" title=\"Novo Nordisk A/S\">NVO</a>) shortens <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642333-novo-nordisk-rebrands-as-novo-in-push-to-win-back-obesity-market\">name to 'Novo.'</a><br/><br/>Verizon (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/VZ\" title=\"Verizon Communications Inc.\">VZ</a>), T-Mobile (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/TMUS\" title=\"T-Mobile US, Inc.\">TMUS</a>) end legal fight <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642631-verizon-t-mobile-end-legal-fight-over-competing-savings-claims\">over ad campaigns</a>.<br/><br/>Iran war cost: $33.4B in four months and <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642738-pentagon-report-iran-war-cost-estimates\">U.S. munitions shortfalls</a>.<br/><br/>Apple (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/AAPL\" title=\"Apple Inc.\">AAPL</a>) releases Siri AI with greater <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642629-apple-releases-long-awaited-new-version-of-siri-with-greater-cross-app-functionality\">cross-app functionality</a>.<br/><br/><a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/PSKY\">Paramount</a> exit could cost California billions of dollars - <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642599-la-study-sees-california-facing-billions-in-economic-losses-if-paramount-pulls-up-stakes\">LA study</a>.<br/><br/>Oprah Winfrey is bringing a music, arts show to <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642638-oprah-winfrey-is-bringing-a-music-and-arts-show-to-sphere-las-vegas\">Sphere Las Vegas</a>.<br/><br/>SA Asks: How can U.S. government realistically <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642622-sa-asks-how-can-the-us-government-realistically-regulate-ai-safety\">regulate AI safety?</a></p> <p class=\"wsb_bold\" data-skip-content-styles=\"\">Today's Markets</p> <p><b>In Asia, </b> Japan flat. Hong Kong <span class=\"red\">-1%</span>. China <span class=\"red\">-0.5%</span>. India <span class=\"red\">-1%</span>.<br/><b>In Europe, at midday, </b> London <span class=\"red\">-0.3%</span>. Paris <span class=\"red\">-0.3%</span>. Frankfurt <span class=\"red\">-0.1%</span>.<br/><b>Futures at 6:30, </b> Dow <span class=\"red\">-0.5%</span>. S&amp;P <span class=\"red\">-0.3%</span>. Nasdaq <span class=\"red\">-0.3%</span>. Crude <span class=\"green\">+2.2%</span> to $103.59. Gold <span class=\"red\">-0.9%</span> to $4,311.90. Bitcoin <span class=\"red\">-1.3%</span> to $76,929.<br/><b>Ten-year Treasury Yi</b><b>eld </b>+2 bps to 5.01%.</p> <p class=\"wsb_bold\" data-skip-content-styles=\"\">On The Calendar</p> <p>Companies reporting today include Trip.com (<a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/symbol/TCOM\" title=\"Trip.com Group Limited\">TCOM</a>).<br/><br/><span class=\"b\">See the <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/earnings/earnings-calendar\">full earnings calendar</a> on Seeking Alpha, as well as <a href=\"https://seekingalpha.com/news/4642479-tuesdays-economic-calendar\">today's economic calendar</a>.</span></p> </div></body></html>",
