            "description": "<html><body><figure class=\"getty-figure\" data-type=\"getty-image\"><picture> <img alt=\"Declining Percentage with Red Arrow\" data-id=\"2189063703\" data-type=\"getty-image\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"987\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) calc(100vw - 36px), (max-width: 1023px) calc(100vw - 132px), (max-width: 1199px) calc(100vw - 666px), (max-width: 1307px) calc(100vw - 708px), 600px\" src=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2189063703/image_2189063703.jpg?io=getty-c-w630\" srcset=\"https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2189063703/image_2189063703.jpg?io=getty-c-w1536 1536w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2189063703/image_2189063703.jpg?io=getty-c-w1280 1280w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2189063703/image_2189063703.jpg?io=getty-c-w1080 1080w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2189063703/image_2189063703.jpg?io=getty-c-w750 750w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2189063703/image_2189063703.jpg?io=getty-c-w640 640w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2189063703/image_2189063703.jpg?io=getty-c-w480 480w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2189063703/image_2189063703.jpg?io=getty-c-w320 320w, https://static.seekingalpha.com/cdn/s3/uploads/getty_images/2189063703/image_2189063703.jpg?io=getty-c-w240 240w\" width=\"1536\"/> </picture><figcaption><p class=\"item-caption\"> </p> <p class=\"item-credits\">J Studios/DigitalVision via Getty Images</p></figcaption></figure> <h2>Introduction</h2> <p data-eci=\"true\">Naturally, most income-focused investors are likely value investors. So, when there's a company with a high dividend yield trading at a discount, a lot of us automatically assume it's an attractive investment.</p> <p>While this may be true, I'm a firm</p></body></html>",
